			"notes": "First release of Shut Up, Grass.\n\nVegetation only drops when you break it with the right tool. Leaves, saplings, crops and leaf litter need a hoe (or any Silk Touch tool); flowers, grass and ground foliage also accept shears. Break them with the wrong tool or bare hands and they drop nothing. Every rule lives in `config/shut-up-grass.json` and reloads on `/reload`. Server-side only, no Fabric API dependency.\n\nDownload the jar matching your Minecraft version. Each jar covers a range:\n\n- 1.20.1 → 1.20, 1.20.1\n- 1.20.4 → 1.20.2 to 1.20.4\n- 1.20.6 → 1.20.5, 1.20.6\n- 1.21.1 → 1.21, 1.21.1\n- 1.21.4 → 1.21.2 to 1.21.4\n- 1.21.5 → 1.21.5\n- 1.21.8 → 1.21.6 to 1.21.8\n- 1.21.10 → 1.21.9, 1.21.10\n- 1.21.11 → 1.21.11\n- 26.1.2 → 26.1 to 26.1.2\n- 26.2 → 26.2"
		}
